   "source": [
    "# Satellite Chlorophyll Calibration and Validation Analysis (Version 3)\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook performs comprehensive calibration and validation of satellite-derived chlorophyll estimates using in situ observations from Upper Klamath Lake, then applies the calibration to Detroit Lake data.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Key Improvements in Version 3:\n",
    "- **Proper MODIS Handling**: Works with log_ratio and ratio data from V3 MODIS extraction\n",
    "- **Direct NDCI Calibration**: Calibrates NDCI directly to in situ chlorophyll (no double transformation)\n",
    "- **OCx-Style Approach**: Uses log10(ratio) → log10(Chl) for MODIS following ocean color standards\n",
    "- **Robust Filtering**: Removes negative and extreme values before calibration\n",
    "- **Cross-Sensor Validation**: Compares Sentinel-2 and MODIS during overlapping periods\n",
    "\n",
    "## Scientific Approach:\n",
    "1. **MODIS**: `log10(Chl) = a * log10(green/red) + b` (OCx standard)\n",
    "2. **Sentinel-2**: `Chl = a * NDCI + b` or `Chl = a * NDCI² + b * NDCI + c` (direct)\n",
    "3. **Calibration**: Fit coefficients using robust regression with in situ data\n",
    "4. **Validation**: Cross-validation and inter-sensor comparison\n",
    "\n",
    "## Data Requirements:\n",
    "\n",
    "### Upper Klamath Lake (Calibration Site):\n",
    "- **In situ data**: `Data/Upper_Klamath_Lake/*.csv`\n",
    "- **Sentinel-2**: `Klamath_S2_NDCI_500m.csv`\n",
    "- **MODIS Aqua**: `Klamath_MODIS_Aqua_500m_ROI.csv` (V3 format with log_ratio)\n",
    "- **MODIS Terra**: `Klamath_MODIS_Terra_500m_ROI.csv` (V3 format with log_ratio)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Detroit Lake (Application Site):\n",
    "- **Sentinel-2**: `Detroit_S2_NDCI_500m.csv`\n",
    "- **MODIS Aqua**: `Detroit_MODIS_Aqua_500m_ROI.csv` (V3 format)\n",
    "- **MODIS Terra**: `Detroit_MODIS_Terra_500m_ROI.csv` (V3 format)"
   ]
  },
